WEBVTT

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:06.320
Morning, Kosaka-san.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:08.860
Good morning, Shinozaki-san.

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.070
Sorry, did I make you wait?

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.690
Kosaka-san looks refreshing
in her summer uniform, too...

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:22.440
What do you think?

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:26.150
I see. She wants me to compliment
her summer uniform.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.820
Yeah, I think it's really great!

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:29.900
I knew you it.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.230
You would like...

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:33.440
...to see my bra.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.900
I'm sorry I responded with such an eager smile!

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:09.570
Look! It's Seiya-sama!

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:11.570
Seiya-sama came to school today!

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:15.480
Hey. Have you been doing well, my babies?

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:19.070
That's Seiya Hoshikawa-kun from our class...

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:22.530
He's as popular with the girls as always.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:25.940
By the way everyone, did you know?

00:02:26.570 --> 00:02:31.570
Ninety percent of male giraffes
mate with other males!

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:34.900
The way he looks when he comes in
from the school gates is wonderful!

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:44.650
We're in the same class, but the way he's
popular with the ladies is on a whole other level.

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:47.570
But what if...

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:53.860
...Kosaka-san becomes infatuated
with Hoshikawa-kun just like the other girls?

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:57.780
No way, I gotta quit thinking strange things like that.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.650
Especially not Kosaka-san, she wouldn't...

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.280
Oh, yeah?!

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:10.190
I-I can't believe Kosaka-san
is talking to a guy besides me...

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:13.440
On top of that, so intimately?!

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:17.400
Th-there's no way Kosaka-san has betrayed me
for Hoshikawa-kun?!

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:19.530
N-no, I'm thinking too much.

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:21.440
Even among friends, when that type of feeling happens...

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:25.570
That's right...

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:29.610
A hug is normal if it's among friends...

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:31.610
Sis, when did you get here?!

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:33.440
Wait, what is it? What happened?

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:38.400
That's right, she has to know understand
how far friends go in the mind of a girl!

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:44.860
Hey Sis, how far would you go with me?

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:46.820
How far? And your face is scary!

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:50.730
Holding hands? A hug? Or maybe...

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.940
Wait, wait! What are you talking about?!

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:54.530
My body's so hot I can't help it!

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:56.610
And that's why I wanted to ask your opinion.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:58.780
S-say something like that sooner!

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:02.610
So this is about what level of behavior is friendship,
and what is not, right?

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:04.940
That type of thing is easy!

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:06.480
Saijo-san.

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:08.650
Before it goes in,
you're friends.

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:11.860
But when it goes all the way in,
you're best friends!

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:16.650
Of course, when they go into a home,
the relationship between friends gets deeper, right?

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:18.780
Right...?

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:21.280
For now, you should confirm the facts!

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:24.230
But if I think about it very carefully,

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:30.070
since it's possible that someone else
could confess to Kosaka-san in the future...

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:34.610
...at a time like this, there's no way
I can stand and hesitate in the distance!

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:35.940
Huh?!

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:36.980
Haru?!

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:40.280
This is the first time I've seen Haru look so imposing!

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:43.780
I feel I can't hold this back any longer...

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:44.860
Oh?

00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:47.230
Shinozaki-san?

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.070
Excuse me...

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:55.940
Uh, sorry to interrupt you!
And I'm really sorry if I'm misunderstanding,

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:59.940
but I have a little-bitty question to ask...
uh, I mean if you have time and it's okay,

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:00.570
and I mean basically...

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:01.530
What a long intro!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:07.940
Well... Are you two good friends?

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:11.110
Actually, from Hoshikawa-san...

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:13.860
No, it's alright. I'll be the one to say it...

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:16.780
Is this perhaps just gossip?

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:18.360
To be precise...

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:22.820
This is advice, I suppose...

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:25.940
On how to become mates with men.

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:31.030
Basically, it's advice on how to
become friends with guys and such.

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:31.780
Huh?

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:38.150
The men around me don't think well of the fact
that I have a lot of friends who are girls...

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:43.650
I've tried multiple times to become friends with them,
but I failed every time.

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:50.360
However, when I saw that
you treat everyone kindly, I thought...

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:55.280
maybe if it's you, we'd be able
to be friends, you know?

00:05:56.030 --> 00:06:01.780
And so, that's the reason why
Hoshikawa-san asked me, your girlfriend.

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:03.110
So that's what it was...

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:06.400
What? So it was all just in Haru's head?

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:08.940
He wanted to become friends, right?

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:11.150
Okay, I see.

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:14.480
If you're really okay with me, I'd be glad to!

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:16.190
Huh?!

00:06:16.780 --> 00:06:20.230
Thanks... I'm so happy!

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:24.900
Up until now, I selfishly thought that
his existence was on a whole other level,

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:28.070
but really he's a normal guy.

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:32.110
Oh no, I misunderstood you and embarrassed myself!

00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:33.280
Misunderstood?

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:37.070
Honestly, I feel like if there were a hole
I'd want to crawl into it!

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:40.440
Hole?

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:44.360
You... want to be in a hole, huh?

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:51.190
If you're okay with me, I will prepare the hole!
As soon as possible!

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:54.320
Really? I'd be grateful for that!

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:58.280
Oh! You'd be grateful for it, huh? For the hole?!

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:00.190
I'm gonna prepare one!

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.230
Hoshikawa-kun, you're a really funny person!

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.730
Digging a hole is great!

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:08.400
Whoa!

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:10.530
Those are huge bamboo decorations!

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:12.940
Come to think of it, today is Tanabata, right?

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:17.030
The one and only day of the year that star-crossed
lovers Orihime and Hikoboshi can meet, huh...

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:18.860
It's kind of romantic.

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:22.980
It is. Not being able to meet in a year,
there's no doubt...

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:24.480
They must be really deprived.

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:26.690
Hey, don't get all lewd now!

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:28.150
Huh?

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:33.110
Oh, no... I thought the topic was being deprived...

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:34.730
I... I jumped the gun!

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:37.070
Oh my, you two are here too.

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:38.650
Sis...

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:40.940
I'm going to go put my own decoration on now.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:43.110
I wonder what she wished for...

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.610
A wish for the health of my family?

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.400
I'm so glad, Sis.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.400
We'll definitely all be together for a long time!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.280
All done!

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.570
I pray that this will reach the heavens!

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:55.650
Okay. So, shall we burn it?

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:58.610
Hey! Don't you look at other people's papers!

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:00.480
Jeez, I'm gonna put another up over there.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:03.230
Huh? She still wants to put up nonsense things?

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:06.150
Hey, you can't fool me!

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:10.190
I hope that I will become a B-cup.

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:13.070
I'm not asking for it
because I can't fool anyone, though!

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:14.070
Idiot! Idiot idiot idiot!

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:15.610
S-sorry...

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:17.360
Boing.

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:20.150
Oh wow, everyone is all together.

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:22.320
Saijo-san, do you have a wish too?

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:23.110
Yes!

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:24.980
What kind of wish will you make?

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:28.820
I have so many, but one of them
is something like this!

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:30.860
Your sisters, huh...

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:33.230
Saijo-san, so you're not an only child, are you?

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:36.030
Oh? Yes, I'm an only child.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:38.070
Huh? By "sisters" you mean...

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:43.150
Dear Sister! Much, much deeper!

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:45.110
God speaks, saying:

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:47.900
"Do not touch upon this topic any further!"

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:53.860
I hope that the world becomes flat-chested. Shizuku.

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:57.190
I hope that we come better friends. Rina.

00:08:57.480 --> 00:09:00.190
Saijo-san, isn't that word missing something important?

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:02.480
It's Seiya-sama!

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:05.940
The amount of girls here... it's Hoshikawa-kun!

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:08.820
Huh, what's wrong?

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:09.860
N-nothing...

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:16.480
715, 716, 717, 718,

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:20.900
The image of him counting the stars of the galaxy
that we still can't see is wonderful!

00:09:21.230 --> 00:09:23.070
719,

00:09:24.900 --> 00:09:26.230
720!

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:30.360
You've been counting for a pretty long time, huh...

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:32.110
Hey, Shinozaki-kun!

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:36.690
However, I can only count 720 stars right now.

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:37.980
No...

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:40.610
Including the star that
just showed up a moment ago,

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:44.780
it's a total of 0721 stars, I think.

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:47.820
Why did you put a 'zero' at the front of that?

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:50.820
Oh, I wonder what I was thinking of?

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:55.070
The Milky Way truly is marvelous...

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:57.610
We can't see it, though.

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:01.980
Milky Way... our galaxy, huh. You must like it.

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:07.650
The way that the stars connect and become a river,
feels like intimacy, maybe?

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:09.610
You really get it, don't you?!

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:11.480
Shinozaki-kun...

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:15.530
I'm feeling the intimacy,
in that "connection" that you speak of...

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:18.360
Connection? So, not with the stars and the river?

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:23.860
I hope that we will connect. Seiya.

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:29.280
I hope that Tanabata won't become
a Hikoboshi x Hikoboshi day. Akiho.

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:30.980
All done.

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:36.650
I wonder what Kosaka-san wished for...

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:40.070
Are you curious about my wish?

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:41.980
I'm curious...

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:45.900
but, judging from the way things are going,
it will probably be something sketchy.

00:10:46.190 --> 00:10:48.940
N-no. I'm not especially curious about it!

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:53.820
You have... no interest?

00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:54.690
Huh?

00:10:54.940 --> 00:11:00.650
This will not be granted by a prayer to God,
but through my discipline as a girlfriend!

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:04.030
If I'm not wrong... did I just shatter her Flag?!

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:06.900
W-wait, Kosaka-san!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:15.940
D-don't show this to anyone else, okay?

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:20.860
Uh, tomorrow is finally
the school-wide softball tournament...

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:24.480
so we're going to use our time
during gym class today to practice for it.

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:26.030
First, let's warm up.

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:33.600
Bouncy, Bouncy, Bouncy, Bouncy, Bouncy, Bouncy, Bouncy, Bouncy,

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:33.980
Bouncy, Bouncy, Bouncy, Bouncy

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:35.700
Wow...
Bouncy, Bouncy, Bouncy, Bouncy

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:35.730
Wow...

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:39.650
It's alright to shamelessly stare.

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:40.730
Huh?!

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:44.110
I'd planned to eventually show you from the start.

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:45.650
Huh... Huh?!

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:47.900
Since I am already prepared for this...

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:52.230
N-no, in a place like this?!

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:54.280
Well... Here you go!

00:11:56.030 --> 00:12:00.570
It makes boys happy when
a name is written in hiragana, right?

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:01.860
Like for school swimsuits.

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:04.360
Huh?! Uh, Yeah, that's right!

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:06.400
Like for school swimsuits.

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:09.860
Shinozaki-san, I'll help you limber up.

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:10.730
Thanks.

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:12.650
I'm going to put a bit of weight on it.

00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:14.650
W-wait, wait, wait!

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:17.190
Y-you can just push on it normally for me!

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:19.440
Oh? Understood.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:22.730
How do you like this?

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:25.150
What in the world are you thinking my normal is?

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:28.530
Okay, practice your respective positions!

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:29.610
Here I go!

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:31.320
Ah, sorry!

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:36.030
Hmm... When I throw it, it seems to curve right.

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:38.030
Please don't worry!

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:41.440
A curve to the right is a trait of the ruler of an empire!

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:43.570
Even if you had said that
about a straight curve, it's wrong!

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:45.610
You'll rule an empire!

00:12:49.230 --> 00:12:51.150
Am I bad at batting, too?

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:56.190
But if possible, I want to look good
in front of Kosaka-san at tomorrow's game.

00:12:57.610 --> 00:12:59.530
You're wonderful, Shinozaki-san!

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:00.780
Oh, yay!

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:02.570
What am I thinking...

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:04.570
You should take off a little bit more...

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:07.440
I mean of the force you use when you hold the bat.

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:08.280
Huh?

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:10.480
I guess I can teach you...

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:13.400
how to handle this stick.

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:16.190
So you're good at that, Hoshikawa-kun? Well then...

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:17.730
Can I ask you to do that?

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:21.400
Okay.

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:25.690
Kosaka, sorry, but please take this
to the storage room for me.

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:26.820
Okay.

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:30.730
Like this, maybe?

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:33.360
Or more like... this?

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:36.860
Yeah... That's pretty good.

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:39.440
Shinozaki-san and Hoshikawa-san's voices...

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:41.570
What are the two of them doing?

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:48.530
Right, the way you grip the stick... yeah, that's nice!

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:53.780
Your teaching method... is really good.

00:13:55.280 --> 00:13:59.110
What are those two doing?!

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:01.480
Are you really looking at it carefully?

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.980
Of course I am!

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:05.980
Oops, you put too much strength into it.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:09.480
At the start, do it so you can engulf the whole thing.

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:12.780
Right, hold it like you're milking something...

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:14.730
Hold it like this, right?

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:17.690
Great! I feel like I can do it now!

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:18.860
"Do it"?!

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:19.860
Kosaka-san?

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:23.070
Wh-what in the world are you doing
in a place like this?!

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:23.900
This is...

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:28.780
No. I should keep what happened here a secret
so I can show her something cool on the day of...

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:34.230
I'll show you properly tomorrow!

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:37.360
You'll show me you two being 'excited' PROPERLY?!

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:40.730
Aoi, give me the compress.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:44.070
Oh my, Itchan. Is it for back pain?

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:48.230
Even as a gym teacher, the daily battles
are pretty tough, right?

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:51.980
Hm? Yeah, I reached my breaking point
in class today.

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:54.730
I knocked them down a peg.

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:56.730
Oh my, really?

00:14:56.900 --> 00:14:59.150
Since you were so rough with them,

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:01.440
your right hand must be sore too, right?

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:04.110
What are you even talking about?

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:06.150
Eternally 17.

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:11.690
Next is the Year 3, Class 1 vs. the Year 2, Class 2 game.

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:13.860
All students please assemble on the field.

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:16.860
Shinozaki-san, where in the world...

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:20.820
He can't possibly be with Hoshikawa-san again...?!

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:24.570
Please, allow me to show you my 'excite' today!

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.690
You're gonna hit a home run on my face?!

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:30.030
N, n-n-n-n-n-n-n-no...!

00:15:30.230 --> 00:15:31.440
SHINOZAKI-SAN!

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:34.730
I can do it, I can do it!

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:40.280
Okay, I'm mentally prepped, and my warm-up is done.

00:15:41.110 --> 00:15:42.820
Sis, are you warming up too?

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:43.610
Grr!

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:46.400
I'm searching for patterns in the enemy!

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:48.530
You're powerless against me!

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:52.730
Jeez! Just because the whole school is competing
doesn't mean you have to play so unfairly!

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:54.400
You don't have to lie!

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:58.230
You're already hiding a ball
in those undies of yours, aren't you?!

00:15:58.230 --> 00:16:00.690
You just really wanted to say that, didn't you?

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:04.980
Okay, I'm going back to my class!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.280
I bet she's a big pain to her class as well.

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:10.940
I..I wonder if I'll be too slow?

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:13.070
She really must be...

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:15.400
Why are you so stiff?

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:18.320
Please only let the other thing get that way!

00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:22.690
It's okay! The most important thing
is that everyone has fun.

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:25.360
So let's both do our best and not worry about it!

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:27.860
Oh, thank you, Ariyama-san!

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:31.190
Ariyama-san is always so cheerful and kind!

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:33.400
Yeah, she's really great, isn't she?

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:35.900
I-I am somehow not convinced!

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:38.230
Wow, so awesome!

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:40.820
Isn't this a lovely swing?

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:43.480
I want a cheer for this swing!

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.900
Kanata, do you have a game soon?

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:49.820
I get it, I'm gonna cheer f-

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:50.780
Haruka-kun!

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:52.900
I'm coming to see your game over there!

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:53.940
Saijo-san?

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:56.610
Oh, do you have a previous engagement?

00:16:57.190 --> 00:17:01.900
If Big Bro isn't gonna be lonely,
I guess Kana is free to leave...

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:04.730
Kanata has matured a bit!

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:08.280
Going so far as to restrain yourself... is so very lovable!

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:11.320
Oh no! When she's matured,
she'll be considered an adult!

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:12.780
Shinozaki-san!

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:14.820
Huh? Kosaka-san!

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:16.320
I'm so glad!

00:17:16.320 --> 00:17:18.730
What's wrong? You seem really worried.

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:20.940
N-no, it's nothing...

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:24.190
As long as Rina-san is the one you're with, you're safe.

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:26.570
Kanata was the one in danger, though...

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:30.940
The next game is Year 2, Class 3 vs. Year 3, Class 2.

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:32.940
All students, please assemble on the field.

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.900
That's our class!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.070
Clink!

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:39.610
Oh, they're starting already!

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:41.360
How's it going?

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:42.530
Ariyama-senpai.

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:44.730
Is Haru working hard?

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:46.730
Yes, just now.

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:49.980
Oh? It's Haru's turn, huh?

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:55.190
With this game, I'm going to show
Kosaka-san that I'm cool!

00:17:57.160 --> 00:18:00.080
Foul!

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:01.530
Dammit!

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:03.530
Haru! Fight!

00:18:03.820 --> 00:18:04.570
Sis?

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.530
She came to cheer me on!

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.190
You've already stroked it three times,

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:13.360
so since it's you, you'll surely
knock one out on the next one!

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.110
If you're cheering me on, thanks!

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.900
If you're heckling me, go home!

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:18.940
Concentrate... concentrate!

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:23.150
I have to put what Hoshikawa-kun
taught me yesterday to use...

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:29.230
I'll be back.

00:18:29.230 --> 00:18:30.320
S-sorry about that!

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:31.820
This one for sure...

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:33.650
It's okay...

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:38.610
If it's him, he can surely send a big hit flying!

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:40.480
Even if it's just one hit!

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:54.840
Exci... Exci... Exciting!

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:56.730
H..Hoshikawa-kun?!

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:57.780
Oh my...

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:58.480
A-a teacher...!

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:04.610
Are you okay? I-I can't believe this happened...

00:19:05.150 --> 00:19:08.190
No problem...

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.730
An unbelievable shift in batting and fielding?!

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:15.530
I'll show you properly tomorrow!

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:18.280
Show you... show you... show you...

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:24.070
N-no. I'm worried that this will only
just damage my purity...

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:24.480
Peek.

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:28.570
Hoshikawa-kun... I'm sorry I'm so bad.

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:31.400
That is not a thing to worry about.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:35.070
That was some great stick handling you did there.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:40.190
No... I can't watch any longer!

00:19:40.690 --> 00:19:42.530
K..Kosaka-san?

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:43.230
Yay!

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:44.780
I-I'm not gonna wash this hand.

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:50.070
Now, the school-wide softball tournament is over.

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:56.110
Maybe there was a whole lot more of everything
that Hoshikawa-kun should have taught me.

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:59.230
More of yesterday's secret practice?!

00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:00.320
Huh?

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:04.070
Kosaka-san, you mean that thing I was doing
with Hoshikawa-kun yesterday?

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:07.690
I'm sorry. Since I heard your voice
I just took a peek...

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:10.860
However, I did not peek at your secret spot!

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:11.730
"Secret spot"?

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:16.070
That was just... because I wanted to at least hit the ball.

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:17.110
Huh?

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:19.780
I got him to teach me some tips on hitting the ball.

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:24.730
At today's game, I wanted to show you
that there was something cool about me.

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:28.610
So then, that was for the sake of softball...

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:32.480
And furthermore, that was for me?

00:20:32.610 --> 00:20:36.480
But it ended with me showing you
how uncool I am.

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:38.530
That is not true.

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:42.900
I'm so happy.

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:47.730
And your right hand is so full of calluses.

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:50.110
Kosaka-san...

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:54.610
This is also proof that you were thinking about me...

00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:58.780
while you continued to handle that stick, right?

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:05.530
That is true, but is there anything you can do
about how you said that?

00:22:37.690 --> 00:22:39.440
Handling the stick...

00:22:39.440 --> 00:22:43.320
I certainly held the stick known as a 'bat'
with my hand, though.

00:22:43.320 --> 00:22:44.570
Um...

00:22:45.190 --> 00:22:49.070
I guess I have to say it like it's a joke, then...

00:22:49.280 --> 00:22:52.980
Huh? So then you were just covering up
your confusion earlier?

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:05.980
The rain made her cold, so letting her
use the shower first was probably the right thing.

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:11.360
Huh? She's shampooing her hair?

00:23:14.860 --> 00:23:17.860
And now she's washing her body?

00:23:19.940 --> 00:23:21.230
What was that just now?!

00:23:21.230 --> 00:23:24.070
Did something happen
while she was w-w-washing herself?!

00:23:24.820 --> 00:23:26.440
A few minutes later...

00:23:27.030 --> 00:23:29.570
I'm done with my shower... Shinozaki-san!

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:31.900
Your face looks red... Is it a cold?!

00:23:31.900 --> 00:23:34.230
N-n-no... It's nothing...

00:23:34.230 --> 00:23:36.320
I'm really sorry!
